# Fast gate only. `pnpm check` — which also runs the unit suite, the e2e suite
# and a full build — belongs in CI (.github/workflows/ci.yml), where it can run
# on a matrix and in parallel without blocking the push.
#
# A hook that takes minutes gets bypassed with `--no-verify`, and a gate people
# routinely skip is not a gate. Lint plus typecheck catches the overwhelming
# majority of what would fail CI, in seconds rather than minutes.
echo "→ lint + typecheck (full suite runs in CI)"
pnpm check:quick
